<title>UK: North Sea Troll field to load 7.1 mln bls in Jan.</title>
<headline>North Sea Troll field to load 7.1 mln bls in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The North Sea Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 7.1 million barrels of crude in January, slightly below the 7.4 million scheduled for December, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the January programme comprised 13 cargoes in total, the same number as December.  </p>
<p>Traders said the programme comprised four cargoes of 400,000 barrels, two cargoes of 500,000 barrels, five cargoes of 600,000 barrels, one cargo of 700,000 barrels and one cargo of 800,000 barrels.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
